{"id":"kt-beg-008","chapterId":"kt-beg-01","title":"Sequences و Lazy Processing","order":35,"durationMin":50,"objectives":["Sequence","lazy evaluation","trade-off با Collection"],"blocks":[{"type":"CODE","language":"kotlin","code":"val result = (1..1_000_000).asSequence()\n    .filter { it % 2 == 0 }\n    .map { it * 2 }\n    .take(5)\n    .toList()"},{"type":"NOTE","text":"Sequence همیشه سریع‌تر نیست؛ برای زنجیره‌های کوتاه و collection کوچک overhead آن ممکن است مزیت نداشته باشد."}]} 